{
    "id":  3436,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Connector for COB + SMD LED strips - 8mm - 10mm - IP65",
    "reference":  "90931-8-UND",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eSolderless transparent connector for non-waterproof IP65 COB and SMD strips with 8mm PCB. Our IP65 quick connector allows connections to be made on LED strips without the need for soldering by simply tightening the clips on the side of the connector. Super easy to fit.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eConnector for COB and SMD LED strips - 8mm - 10mm - IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith our connector you can connect all types of 8mm LED strips.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can use it with your 8mm LED strips:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e-For COB LED strips.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e-For SMD LED strips.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is very easy to install thanks to the quick click system.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou have to take into account the dimensions of the connector if you want to insert it in an aluminium or polycarbonate profile.\u003c/p\u003e",
